   to do so.

7. Termination. Any breach terminates this license automatically. All rights
   not expressly granted are reserved.

8. No warranty. The Source Code is provided "as is", without warranty of any
   kind. The copyright holder is not liable for any damages arising from it.

Permissions beyond this license: contact the copyright holder via GitHub
(https://github.com/LeoAlecksey).
